---
// CabinetShell: the extruded box (Design 06 sections 1-2, T02).
//
// The front is a rectangular div (its text is never transformed), the top
// plane and the right wall are clip-path parallelograms whose diagonals are
// exactly the depth by the depth, so the angle is 45 degrees at every
// width. One solid fill per face, one 1px line where the geometry needs it.
// Paint order: right, front, top; the top-left 72 x 72 triangle stays page
// field, which is what makes the object read as placed in front of the page.
//
// The front's bottom bleeds one depth below the page; the cabinet clips it.
---

<div class="cabinet-shell">
	<div class="cabinet-shell__top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="cabinet-shell__right" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="cabinet-shell__front">
		<div class="cabinet-front__face">
			<slot />
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
